WEBVTT

01:31.136 --> 01:34.068
[Episode 29]

01:34.959 --> 01:36.159
The sandbag is ready.

01:36.159 --> 01:37.359
It can warm you up.

01:37.359 --> 01:38.859
I'll apply it for you.

01:44.959 --> 01:46.280
I can do it myself.

01:46.280 --> 01:50.000
Director Meng,
since you're the future empress,

01:50.000 --> 01:54.540
do you mean to keep a distance from me?

01:55.599 --> 01:57.459
That's not what I meant.

01:58.959 --> 02:00.700
What's wrong with you?

02:06.159 --> 02:10.219
I just realized how fast things change.

02:11.039 --> 02:14.419
Is the Censorate about to disband?

02:22.400 --> 02:23.400
Look at this.

02:23.400 --> 02:25.639
See how wonderful these gifts are.

02:25.639 --> 02:27.159
No gossipers will dare

02:27.159 --> 02:29.240
to say a single word against our lady now.

02:29.240 --> 02:31.280
Sure, all thanks to the Second Young Master.

02:31.280 --> 02:33.520
He finally shut up those rumor-mongers.

02:33.520 --> 02:35.919
Stop calling him Second Young Master.

02:35.919 --> 02:38.159
He is now Grand Tutor Shen's son-in-law.

02:38.159 --> 02:39.840
But then again,

02:39.840 --> 02:43.379
I've long noticed
that he had feelings for our lady.

02:45.199 --> 02:46.699
Madam.

02:47.960 --> 02:51.120
Zhi Li will be back with Nian.
Go fetch the head of the house.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.800
Tell him not to only focus on the cooking.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.300
Yes.

03:00.759 --> 03:02.259
Nian.

03:05.000 --> 03:07.120
Now that Zhi Li has married you,

03:07.120 --> 03:09.000
there are some things I must say.

03:09.000 --> 03:11.039
No matter what happened before,

03:11.039 --> 03:14.080
from now on, you two must support each other.

03:14.080 --> 03:16.000
Do your best to work on your marriage.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.360
Don't worry, Father.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.400
I will definitely cherish Zhi Li
like the apple of my eye.

03:19.400 --> 03:22.020
I won't let her come to any harm.

03:24.120 --> 03:25.620
Good.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.500
Zhi Li.

03:32.360 --> 03:34.560
Although Nian indulges you in every way,

03:34.560 --> 03:36.599
you've married him,

03:36.599 --> 03:41.159
so you must not waywardly prank Nian again.

03:41.159 --> 03:45.340
Although I dote on you,
I will also stand up for Nian.

03:46.400 --> 03:49.939
Father, I will be a good wife.

03:51.560 --> 03:53.060
Good.

03:54.680 --> 03:58.719
Zhi Li, Nian is the only son in his family.

03:58.719 --> 04:02.159
If you can soon have his child,

04:02.159 --> 04:07.520
it may rest the souls of his late parents.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.599
Father.

04:08.599 --> 04:11.639
Zhi Li loves the sweet and sour ribs
you cooked.

04:11.639 --> 04:13.680
When you have time, you must teach me.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.960
In the future, I'll cook it for Zhi Li.

04:15.960 --> 04:18.019
I should have taught you long ago.

04:21.360 --> 04:25.360
If Zhi Shu heard me say this,

04:25.360 --> 04:29.319
he would get all jealous and compete
with you over who loves Zhi Li more.

04:29.319 --> 04:31.879
Zhi Shu is always competitive.

04:31.879 --> 04:34.879
You know what?

04:34.879 --> 04:37.899
He used to fight with Zhi Li over a pork rib.

04:38.680 --> 04:41.399
Now, with your help,

04:41.399 --> 04:43.879
Zhi Shu won't be able to snatch any away.

04:43.879 --> 04:45.680
Zhi Shu still hasn't returned.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.920
He even missed my wedding with Nian.

04:47.920 --> 04:50.079
He hasn't even sent a letter home.

04:50.079 --> 04:53.439
He is on a mission and can't make it.

04:53.439 --> 04:56.199
When he returns,
we must get together for a drink.

04:56.199 --> 04:57.279
Father.

04:57.279 --> 04:58.319
Get together.

04:58.319 --> 04:59.819
Here.

05:05.959 --> 05:08.560
Father, is your chest hurting again?

05:08.560 --> 05:09.839
Quickly get the medicine.

05:09.839 --> 05:11.339
It's fine.

05:12.319 --> 05:15.019
It's fine. An old ailment.

05:15.879 --> 05:17.399
It sounds ridiculous,

05:17.399 --> 05:22.240
but in the past,
Zhi Shu always made my chest hurt from anger.

05:22.240 --> 05:26.860
Now, I can't even blame it on him.

05:44.680 --> 05:47.519
Your Majesty!

05:47.519 --> 05:49.240
Your Majesty!

05:49.240 --> 05:52.660
Your Majesty, an urgent letter from Qingzhou.

05:54.124 --> 05:56.404
[Urgent Report:
Mr. Shen Zhi Shu has died from exhaustion.]

06:02.879 --> 06:04.379
Your Majesty!

06:11.808 --> 06:19.808
[Shen Mansion]

06:37.680 --> 06:41.079
You brat, come out here!

06:41.079 --> 06:42.639
I want to speak to you face to face.

06:42.639 --> 06:44.139
Zhi Shu...

06:46.879 --> 06:48.939
While on an official mission,

06:50.199 --> 06:51.699
he encountered danger.

06:55.040 --> 06:58.040
Come out here!

06:58.040 --> 07:01.399
I am a soldier from Qingzhou.
Under General Huo's order,

07:01.399 --> 07:05.420
I escorted Mr. Shen home.

07:10.079 --> 07:13.920
You must be mistaken.

07:13.920 --> 07:16.210
Zhi Shu wouldn't leave us

07:16.210 --> 07:20.180
without even a word.

07:25.480 --> 07:26.980
Zhi Shu...

07:28.240 --> 07:29.740
My son!

07:31.199 --> 07:32.939
Zhi Shu!

07:34.160 --> 07:36.220
My son!

07:38.079 --> 07:40.779
Father!

07:47.399 --> 07:50.600
You said you'd give me the other half
of the bronze tally on my birthday.

07:50.600 --> 07:51.600
Unfortunately,

07:51.600 --> 07:53.800
I'm going on a mission,
so I'm afraid I won't make it back in time.

07:53.800 --> 07:55.439
Can I ask for my birthday gift in advance?

07:55.439 --> 08:00.120
What I meant was,
when you can stand on your own

08:00.120 --> 08:02.959
and shoulder your responsibility
as a loyal subject,

08:02.959 --> 08:05.879
you'll get the other half
of the tiger-head tally.

08:05.879 --> 08:09.160
Father, you're too stingy.

08:09.160 --> 08:12.040
I've been asking for the other half
for three years.

08:12.040 --> 08:14.560
If you don't give it to me,
I'll trade this half for liquor money.

08:14.560 --> 08:18.259
I dare you, you brat.

08:21.479 --> 08:24.120
Father, after I trade it for money,
I'll buy you the most expensive liquor.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.240
Before he left,

08:25.240 --> 08:28.630
he happily showed off to me

08:28.630 --> 08:32.220
that he was appointed
as a fourth-rank Supervisory Censor.

08:34.440 --> 08:37.279
He even asked me for a birthday gift.

08:37.279 --> 08:41.139
But I scolded him in case he'd get arrogant.

08:46.639 --> 08:49.139
If I had known it'd be
the last time we'd see each other...

08:53.399 --> 08:54.907
Now, I have no chance

08:56.331 --> 08:59.820
to give this bronze tally to him again.

09:01.279 --> 09:02.980
Zhi Shu promised

09:05.360 --> 09:07.899
that he would prepare for the wedding
and marry me into the family

09:08.919 --> 09:10.659
when he returned.

09:15.104 --> 09:16.788
[Birth Booklet]

09:22.360 --> 09:25.000
Miss Yan, this is your birth booklet.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.379
[Birth Booklet]
Please take it back.

09:35.136 --> 09:38.679
[Marriage Contract]

09:38.679 --> 09:41.720
Before he left,
Zhi Shu wrote the marriage contract,

09:41.720 --> 09:43.440
prepared the betrothal gifts,

09:43.440 --> 09:47.120
and begged me
to prepare Three Letters and Six Rites.

09:47.120 --> 09:51.340
He wanted to marry you in a grand manner
when he returned.

10:03.639 --> 10:06.580
Let's see who dares
to lay a finger on her today!

10:07.879 --> 10:10.399
Fu Zhi, sorry I am late.

10:10.399 --> 10:12.320
If I am to marry Fu Zhi,

10:12.320 --> 10:13.720
the Six Rites must be complete,

10:13.720 --> 10:15.879
and the Three Letters shall be in full.

10:15.879 --> 10:17.480
On an auspicious day,

10:17.480 --> 10:19.960
I shall arrive with a great procession

10:19.960 --> 10:22.600
and have Fu Zhi marry into our Shen family
in full ceremony.

10:22.600 --> 10:26.919
I simply cannot believe that Mr. Shen,
surrounded by noble ladies of the capital,

10:26.919 --> 10:29.799
would truly be willing to forsake
such a life of dazzling splendor,

10:29.799 --> 10:31.995
to pledge a lifelong devotion

10:31.995 --> 10:35.600
to a merchant's daughter like me.

10:35.600 --> 10:37.679
What if I cut off all other romantic ties?

10:37.679 --> 10:42.379
Then clean up all your mess

10:44.480 --> 10:46.480
before you come to ask me again.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.559
I promise you.

10:47.559 --> 10:50.340
If I flirt with any woman,
you can just leave me.

11:05.360 --> 11:07.232
Wait for me.

11:07.232 --> 11:09.108
[Shen Zhi Shu]

11:18.240 --> 11:21.159
Zhi Shu and I haven't formally married yet,

11:21.159 --> 11:23.720
but I've already accepted him as my husband.

11:23.720 --> 11:26.080
If you don't mind,

11:26.080 --> 11:28.139
I am willing to be your daughter-in-law.

11:31.840 --> 11:33.419
Don't be silly.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.840
You are in the prime of your youth.

11:35.840 --> 11:38.240
Don't ruin your entire life. Get up.

11:38.240 --> 11:39.860
I have made up my mind.

11:40.879 --> 11:42.379
Unless...

11:45.399 --> 11:47.299
you are unwilling to accept me.

11:51.759 --> 11:54.100
Only now do I truly understand

11:55.000 --> 11:58.759
why Zhi Shu had eyes only for you.

11:58.759 --> 12:01.000
Zhi Shu is quite lucky

12:01.000 --> 12:03.379
to have your sincere love.

12:05.440 --> 12:09.100
Good child, please get up.

12:10.679 --> 12:14.480
Good child, from now on, we are family.

12:14.480 --> 12:16.019
We're family.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.220
Father.

12:23.039 --> 12:24.539
Mother.

12:37.480 --> 12:39.000
Director Meng, don't worry.

12:39.000 --> 12:42.200
This medicine can
make Miss Yan sleep all day soundly.

12:42.200 --> 12:44.139
She hasn't slept the whole journey.

12:45.200 --> 12:48.659
We have to let her rest well in this way.

12:51.559 --> 12:56.519
Miss Meng, how is Ms. Yan?

12:56.519 --> 12:57.919
Isn't that a stupid question?

12:57.919 --> 13:00.320
Just thinking I'll never see Mr. Shen again,

13:00.320 --> 13:01.759
I feel so sad,

13:01.759 --> 13:04.200
let alone Ms. Yan.

13:04.200 --> 13:07.240
Just last month,
Mr. Shen taught us how to make new liquor.

13:07.240 --> 13:09.120
He said he'd taste it after coming back.

13:09.120 --> 13:11.299
Who the hell killed him?

13:12.240 --> 13:15.500
Mr. Shen was also a member of the Censorate.

13:16.759 --> 13:19.059
I will definitely not let him die in vain.

13:25.200 --> 13:28.740
And I will not let you cry all the time.

13:50.840 --> 13:53.519
Your Majesty, your wounds haven't healed yet.

13:53.519 --> 13:54.840
You must stop now.

13:54.840 --> 13:56.399
If the wounds reopen,

13:56.399 --> 13:59.759
the late emperor will blame me.

13:59.759 --> 14:03.139
I am just injured, not dead.

14:11.799 --> 14:14.820
Chief Steward You, let me handle it.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.159
Director Meng, please persuade His Majesty.

14:19.159 --> 14:21.879
He not only keeps practicing with his injury,

14:21.879 --> 14:24.340
but also hasn't eaten anything all day.

14:36.559 --> 14:38.500
Your Majesty, I know how sad you are.

14:40.399 --> 14:43.039
I will avenge Mr. Shen's death.

14:43.039 --> 14:47.820
If you discover old acquaintances of yours
in the Blood Moon Society,

14:48.879 --> 14:50.740
what will you do?

14:51.480 --> 14:52.980
Trust me, Your Majesty.

14:53.720 --> 14:57.039
I get along well with Situ Xue,
but I have a line in my heart.

14:57.039 --> 15:00.899
If the Blood Moon Society harms the people,
I will never let them off.

15:01.799 --> 15:04.399
Your Majesty, your wounds
have not yet healed.

15:04.399 --> 15:06.299
Let me apply medicine for you, Your Majesty.

15:14.279 --> 15:16.600
Your Highness, it's past the hour of Zi.

15:16.600 --> 15:19.799
The contact hasn't arrived yet.
There might be a change.

15:19.799 --> 15:20.879
Wait a little longer.

15:20.879 --> 15:24.080
Your Highness,
the Blood Moon Society is fickle.

15:24.080 --> 15:27.360
Last time, they not only broke the agreement
but also killed our envoy.

15:27.360 --> 15:32.120
Can you trust such untrustworthy people?

15:32.120 --> 15:34.279
Last time, it happened suddenly.

15:34.279 --> 15:36.759
I always feel
there was something fishy about it.

15:36.759 --> 15:39.600
I will personally negotiate
with the Blood Moon Society again.

15:39.600 --> 15:43.000
But your brother
strongly advocates appeasement.

15:43.000 --> 15:47.440
I'm afraid your connection
with the Blood Moon Society...

15:47.440 --> 15:50.480
My brother is quite indecisive

15:50.480 --> 15:51.919
and extremely naive.

15:51.919 --> 15:54.200
He foolishly believes a marriage contract

15:54.200 --> 15:56.080
can bring peace.

15:56.080 --> 15:58.360
When Ying Gua refused a marriage alliance.

15:58.360 --> 16:01.600
Beijian's dignity was already
trampled underfoot.

16:01.600 --> 16:05.360
Wolves do not wag their tails and beg,

16:05.360 --> 16:07.120
while only dogs do.

16:07.120 --> 16:08.950
In the past two years, at the border,

16:08.950 --> 16:12.320
the Ning Empire has increased troops,
stockpiled grain, and fortified cities,

16:12.320 --> 16:15.840
very likely to trap us to death
in the northern desert.

16:15.840 --> 16:18.519
This time, I will show them

16:18.519 --> 16:21.399
what the true armored cavalry is.

16:21.399 --> 16:23.519
I will also prove to my father

16:23.519 --> 16:27.799
that the land is not won
by kneeling and begging,

16:27.799 --> 16:30.759
but by fighting with swords.

16:30.759 --> 16:33.179
Your Highness, someone is coming.

17:19.759 --> 17:21.400
Master.

17:21.400 --> 17:23.799
I've removed the misunderstanding
with the Second Prince of Beijian.

17:23.799 --> 17:28.039
It's been confirmed that someone indeed
impersonated us to sabotage the alliance.

17:28.039 --> 17:29.096
Second Prince of Beijian

17:29.096 --> 17:31.960
has agreed to ally with us
to attack the Ning Empire.

17:31.960 --> 17:35.160
Their blood will not be shed in vain.

17:35.160 --> 17:37.700
The blood debts Ning owes

17:37.700 --> 17:41.380
must be repaid
with countless lives of their people.

17:47.920 --> 17:50.279
Now, their court is in turmoil,

17:50.279 --> 17:53.920
and our princess
is about to reach the peak of power.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.880
Once her memory is awakened,

17:56.880 --> 18:02.720
we will immediately
help our princess restore our land!

18:02.720 --> 18:05.519
Help our princess restore our land!

18:05.519 --> 18:08.359
Help our princess restore our land!

18:08.359 --> 18:11.160
Help our princess restore our land!

18:11.160 --> 18:14.779
Help our princess restore our land!

18:28.320 --> 18:31.476
[Spirit Tablet of Shen Zhi Shu]

18:54.368 --> 18:58.612
[Shen Mansion]

19:03.400 --> 19:07.259
Master, Master Zhi Shu's spirit has returned.

19:26.359 --> 19:29.880
Father, Mother,

19:29.880 --> 19:31.380
I'm back.

19:37.400 --> 19:38.900
Zhi Shu.

19:46.279 --> 19:47.779
Zhi Shu.

19:58.039 --> 20:01.980
Sorry, I made you worry.

20:03.400 --> 20:05.099
My son!

20:08.839 --> 20:12.180
It's good that you're back.

20:15.160 --> 20:16.660
Master.

20:23.519 --> 20:25.019
Fu Zhi.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.900
Shen Zhi Shu...

20:47.680 --> 20:49.599
How could you?

20:49.599 --> 20:52.599
Do you know how much spirit money
I've burned for you?

20:52.599 --> 20:55.740
Do you know how heartbroken I was?

20:57.079 --> 20:59.859
How can you joke about life and death?

21:13.640 --> 21:15.140
Let me see.

21:15.880 --> 21:17.380
It will scare you.

21:35.839 --> 21:37.559
Father.

21:37.559 --> 21:40.819
Are you disappointed in me?

21:41.799 --> 21:44.900
Throughout your life,
you've made so many achievements.

21:45.599 --> 21:48.220
I'm afraid
I'll never be able to do better than you.

21:50.079 --> 21:53.819
The only thing to be proud of
was my handsome face.

21:54.799 --> 21:57.099
Sadly, I've lost the only advantage.

22:01.680 --> 22:04.019
As the eldest son of the family,

22:04.720 --> 22:07.079
you've kept His Majesty company
since childhood.

22:07.079 --> 22:11.019
At the age of 20, you became an official
through our family's prestige.

22:12.440 --> 22:16.079
Compared to the hard-working scholars,
you're quite fortunate.

22:16.079 --> 22:19.079
But facing great honor and favor,

22:19.079 --> 22:21.359
you can't be weak

22:21.359 --> 22:23.319
academically or physically.

22:23.319 --> 22:26.119
As His Majesty's trusted friend,

22:26.119 --> 22:28.759
you must not have great ambition for power,

22:28.759 --> 22:31.240
nor can you be completely unambitious.

22:31.240 --> 22:32.880
More importantly,

22:32.880 --> 22:34.267
you shoulder the heavy responsibility

22:34.267 --> 22:38.500
of continuing the glory of the entire family.

22:41.400 --> 22:43.480
I was extremely tough on you

22:43.480 --> 22:46.519
just in case you'd get complacent
with even small achievements.

22:46.519 --> 22:48.099
So I...

22:50.000 --> 22:52.539
I constantly suppressed you.

22:55.720 --> 22:57.859
After hearing the news about you,

22:59.200 --> 23:01.500
I've always wanted to tell you

23:04.799 --> 23:07.579
that I'm proud of you.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.779
I was wrong.

23:19.480 --> 23:21.440
I never expected

23:21.440 --> 23:24.539
to hear an old fogey like you apologize.

23:26.559 --> 23:28.960
If I had come back half a month later,

23:28.960 --> 23:31.279
wouldn't you have given me the entire family?

23:31.279 --> 23:32.779
You...

23:34.680 --> 23:36.220
You brat!

23:38.240 --> 23:39.980
It must have hurt badly.

23:42.880 --> 23:45.000
Compared to when you used to spank me before,

23:45.000 --> 23:47.339
this little pain is nothing.

24:01.640 --> 24:04.299
<i>Although I was injured, I was also lucky.</i>

24:05.160 --> 24:06.880
<i>I took the Blood Moon Society's token</i>

24:06.880 --> 24:09.240
<i>and was rescued by a member of them.</i>

24:09.240 --> 24:12.680
While recovering in the Blood Moon Society,
I got important information.

24:12.680 --> 24:15.039
Mr. Shangguan is not only alive,

24:15.039 --> 24:17.299
but also hiding right within the court.

24:19.160 --> 24:22.766
I should have expected
that he wouldn't die that easily.

24:22.766 --> 24:25.960
Your Majesty,
are you going to immediately investigate?

24:25.960 --> 24:28.640
But if handled improperly,
there will surely be infighting.

24:28.640 --> 24:31.039
And when the Blood Moon Society
and Beijian join forces,

24:31.039 --> 24:32.920
the whole country will be
under attack from inside and out.

24:32.920 --> 24:34.920
But the First Prince of Beijian
proposed a marriage alliance,

24:34.920 --> 24:37.739
which means a betrayal
to the Blood Moon Society.

24:37.739 --> 24:40.279
So Mr. Shangguan is colluding
with the Second Prince.

24:40.279 --> 24:41.599
Very likely.

24:41.599 --> 24:44.160
I heard the Second Prince has been
at odds with his brother.

24:44.160 --> 24:47.359
And he is more of a warmonger
compared to his brother.

24:47.359 --> 24:50.119
He is quite cunning
and must be guarded against.

24:50.119 --> 24:52.440
Regardless, Your Majesty,
if you reject the marriage alliance,

24:52.440 --> 24:54.200
I'm afraid war will be unavoidable.

24:54.200 --> 24:58.200
The whole land was won through fights.

24:58.200 --> 25:00.920
The two princes are both very cunning
and ambitious.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.559
Since they secretly colluded
with the Blood Moon Society,

25:02.559 --> 25:04.920
I don't believe they will keep any promise.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.440
He has proposed a marriage alliance

25:06.440 --> 25:08.839
merely because he fears our border cavalry.

25:08.839 --> 25:11.202
The misunderstanding
between Beijian and the Blood Moon Society

25:11.202 --> 25:12.839
will be removed sooner or later.

25:12.839 --> 25:14.119
My father once said

25:14.119 --> 25:16.619
that Beijian is ambitious and cunning.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.799
I'm ready to go to battle at any time.

25:18.799 --> 25:21.680
But before that, we must find Shangguan.

25:21.680 --> 25:23.460
I suspect

25:24.920 --> 25:26.779
that Shangguan is close to us.

25:29.519 --> 25:31.960
When I first came here with Your Majesty,

25:31.960 --> 25:33.680
I was not an official yet.

25:33.680 --> 25:36.819
I boldly asked Your Majesty
for a post in the Censorate.

25:38.640 --> 25:40.619
I was even scolded by Your Majesty for it.

25:43.680 --> 25:48.079
I still remember how bold you were.

25:48.079 --> 25:51.220
And I knew the position was destined for you.

25:51.839 --> 25:53.469
Now,

25:54.240 --> 25:57.200
you've indeed fulfilled your promise.

25:57.200 --> 25:59.059
You have even done better

26:00.599 --> 26:02.099
than I expected.

26:04.160 --> 26:07.200
When I was a new official,
I was almost alone.

26:07.200 --> 26:09.920
Fu Zhi was the only person I cared about.

26:09.920 --> 26:12.599
That's why I had no scruples.

26:12.599 --> 26:16.440
I never hesitated at all to dig up corpses,

26:16.440 --> 26:18.519
investigate cases, and handle Ling Yun Fei.

26:18.519 --> 26:22.740
But now,
there are more people I want to protect.

26:23.359 --> 26:25.500
So I have learned what fear is.

26:27.680 --> 26:29.880
We are all afraid of losing.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.519
During this period of time,

26:31.519 --> 26:35.900
I've helplessly watched those close to me
depart one after another.

26:40.279 --> 26:41.900
Zhi Shu's incident

26:44.519 --> 26:46.420
scared me even more.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.859
I rule the entire land,

27:16.079 --> 27:18.819
yet I'm afraid
I cannot protect those I care about.

27:25.400 --> 27:27.960
I will never leave you, Your Majesty.

27:27.960 --> 27:31.819
I wish to continue working
in the Censorate for Your Majesty.

27:42.680 --> 27:44.180
Meng Ting Hui.

27:45.279 --> 27:46.859
Let's get married.

27:49.720 --> 27:51.559
Now that the situation is stable,

27:51.559 --> 27:53.500
no one can stop us anymore.

27:54.400 --> 27:57.599
I personally made this hairpin
for three months,

27:57.599 --> 27:59.960
hoping to put up your hair
and crown you with it

27:59.960 --> 28:01.460
in front of the whole country.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.920
Your Majesty,

28:06.920 --> 28:10.960
I cannot marry you now.

28:10.960 --> 28:11.960
Why not?

28:11.960 --> 28:13.579
Your Majesty, you know me.

28:14.519 --> 28:16.920
I've done it all

28:16.920 --> 28:19.559
to tackle the ills in the country.

28:19.559 --> 28:23.319
The Blood Moon Society intends
to overthrow the entire country.

28:23.319 --> 28:25.319
What terrifies me even more is

28:25.319 --> 28:28.079
that Shangguan is lurking right in the court.

28:28.079 --> 28:29.839
So Your Majesty,

28:29.839 --> 28:32.200
please allow me
to investigate the Blood Moon Society.

28:32.200 --> 28:35.140
Anything else is fine,
but not the Blood Moon Society.

28:36.000 --> 28:39.680
I've entrusted the investigation
entirely to Zhi Shu.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.660
Your Majesty,
you're hiding something from me.

28:43.680 --> 28:45.759
I used to ask Your Majesty

28:45.759 --> 28:48.440
if we were already honest with each other.

28:48.440 --> 28:50.015
Turns out

28:50.723 --> 28:52.839
we're not yet.

28:52.839 --> 28:54.799
I have to be wary of anything

28:54.799 --> 28:56.640
related to the country.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.140
Even with you,

29:00.759 --> 29:03.539
I cannot be completely honest.

29:09.000 --> 29:10.859
I will take my leave.

29:17.856 --> 29:20.768
[Shen Mansion]

29:20.768 --> 29:25.108
[Integrity of Pine and Bamboo]

29:37.160 --> 29:41.180
Shen Zhi Shu,
how long are you going to hide from me?

29:42.799 --> 29:45.539
Fu Zhi, let's break up.

29:48.599 --> 29:50.299
Don't come anymore.

29:54.998 --> 29:56.545
Break up?

30:01.759 --> 30:04.059
You personally wrote the marriage contract.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.740
Are you not going to honor it?

30:12.400 --> 30:13.980
I failed to keep my promise.

30:15.079 --> 30:17.279
My body now has scars.

30:17.279 --> 30:19.039
Even my face...

30:19.039 --> 30:21.559
It's just scars.

30:21.559 --> 30:23.480
Be a real man and hold your head high.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.180
What's the big deal?

30:31.200 --> 30:33.279
I actually think

30:33.279 --> 30:37.319
that with this scar,
you look even more manly.

30:37.319 --> 30:38.799
I'm serious.

30:38.799 --> 30:42.819
As a subject,
I've long put life and death out of my mind.

30:45.640 --> 30:47.680
Now, since our country is in a crisis,
internally and externally,

30:47.680 --> 30:49.819
our family bears heavy responsibilities.

30:51.359 --> 30:54.700
Maybe on an official mission,
I won't just get injured.

31:18.799 --> 31:20.740
I'll wait for you to come back then.

31:21.640 --> 31:25.700
No matter what,
I can wait for you my whole life.

31:29.400 --> 31:35.420
I like the charming gentleman

31:36.160 --> 31:37.940
who was drunk
and picked flowers for me before.

31:41.119 --> 31:43.079
But right now,

31:43.079 --> 31:46.180
I ache more
for the man standing right before me

31:46.839 --> 31:48.660
with a scar on his face.

31:52.039 --> 31:54.099
He is worth loving for a lifetime.

32:08.608 --> 32:10.644
[Lovesickness]

32:21.799 --> 32:25.559
Meng, His Majesty treats you quite well.

32:25.559 --> 32:27.880
He specially allowed you to bathe here.

32:27.880 --> 32:30.000
Not to mention, for your sake,

32:30.000 --> 32:32.640
he even abolished the ancestral precepts.

32:32.640 --> 32:34.880
It's simply enviable.

32:34.880 --> 32:37.980
Since when did you become his advocate?

32:42.480 --> 32:47.140
He has even bought my best friend.

32:47.799 --> 32:51.220
Nobody backs me up now.

32:52.880 --> 32:54.819
Dear Meng,

32:56.400 --> 33:00.759
no matter what happens in the future,
I will be on your side.

33:00.759 --> 33:03.599
I don't care about any so-called principle.

33:03.599 --> 33:05.839
What I care about is only you.

33:05.839 --> 33:07.240
However,

33:07.240 --> 33:10.359
I think of all men in this world,

33:10.359 --> 33:11.940
only His Majesty is perfect for you.

33:13.240 --> 33:17.240
I know what you've been through.

33:17.240 --> 33:21.619
So I hope someone can protect you.

33:22.319 --> 33:23.819
Fu Zhi.

33:24.799 --> 33:26.640
Marrying His Majesty

33:26.640 --> 33:30.160
means placing myself under the scrutiny

33:30.160 --> 33:32.180
of the entire country.

33:34.720 --> 33:37.160
If I become the empress,

33:37.160 --> 33:39.960
even if I advise him once,

33:39.960 --> 33:43.740
all court officials will say
I interfere in politics.

33:44.448 --> 33:47.420
What I want is not the glory of the empress,

33:48.135 --> 33:50.940
but clear and upright governance.

33:51.880 --> 33:54.339
I want him to be a good ruler.

33:55.018 --> 33:58.079
But I also don't want
to give up my aspirations

33:58.079 --> 33:59.779
or get trapped within the harem.

34:02.119 --> 34:04.380
I understand completely.

34:05.279 --> 34:09.460
But do you really not want to marry him?

34:11.599 --> 34:13.719
Alright, I won't say anymore.

34:13.719 --> 34:15.679
Let's not talk about what's troubling you.

34:15.679 --> 34:19.219
Now, let's just relax.

34:30.440 --> 34:33.679
Meng, when did you get a mark on your body?

34:33.679 --> 34:35.039
What mark?

34:35.039 --> 34:36.920
It looks like a bird.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.039
It's red.

34:38.039 --> 34:39.940
A red bird?

34:51.679 --> 34:55.079
This mark on your back is unique.

34:55.079 --> 34:56.519
Which one are you referring to?

34:56.519 --> 34:58.980
Do you know this image?

35:04.079 --> 35:05.579
<i>Yao.</i>

35:06.360 --> 35:08.500
<i>Shangguan.</i>

35:10.800 --> 35:12.800
This is my father's Black Bird.

35:12.800 --> 35:16.039
It's the most powerful divine bird.

35:16.039 --> 35:18.519
Please, draw one for me too.

35:18.519 --> 35:21.920
Draw one even bigger than the Black Bird.

35:21.920 --> 35:24.760
No, you must draw it for me first.

35:24.760 --> 35:26.760
I want a red bird.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.760
He won't draw it for you.

35:28.760 --> 35:30.639
- He is mine.
- No, he's not!

35:30.639 --> 35:32.000
My father said

35:32.000 --> 35:34.519
Shangguan will be my husband in the future.

35:34.519 --> 35:37.139
Shangguan is mine!

35:37.920 --> 35:39.699
Yao, hurry!

35:43.280 --> 35:45.420
Someone's over there. Chase them!

35:46.920 --> 35:48.360
Are you alright?

35:48.360 --> 35:51.199
Shangguan, your hand!

35:51.199 --> 35:52.320
Keep your voice down.

35:52.320 --> 35:54.719
Where is Xi Xia?

35:54.719 --> 35:56.619
She died for you.

36:01.000 --> 36:04.079
Yao, remember, you must live.

36:04.079 --> 36:06.800
Forget today. Forget who you are.

36:06.800 --> 36:09.380
Retreat! Quickly retreat!

36:10.519 --> 36:13.860
Shangguan!

36:40.079 --> 36:41.900
What happened?

36:53.360 --> 36:55.280
What's wrong?

36:55.280 --> 36:59.059
Your Majesty, let's get married.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.800
Have you thought this through?

37:14.800 --> 37:16.659
I don't want you to force yourself.

37:44.440 --> 37:45.920
<i>By the mandate of heaven,</i>

37:45.920 --> 37:47.480
<i>I rule over the land.</i>

37:47.480 --> 37:50.119
Meng Ting Hui is valiant,

37:50.119 --> 37:53.280
virtuous, and upright.

37:53.280 --> 37:56.559
I hereby make her empress of the country.

37:56.559 --> 37:59.000
Relevant offices choose an auspicious day
and prepare the Six Rites.

37:59.000 --> 38:02.199
I'll personally ride the imperial carriage
and escort her into the palace.

38:02.199 --> 38:04.780
Relevant officials apply the decree.

38:26.079 --> 38:27.579
Yin Qing.

38:34.592 --> 38:36.660
[Records of Mountains and Rivers]

38:43.280 --> 38:44.820
Over the last three years,

38:45.880 --> 38:49.579
I have never noticed this scar on your hand.

38:55.679 --> 38:58.480
You've been focused on fighting evil.

38:58.480 --> 39:00.960
You never care about trivial things.

39:00.960 --> 39:05.059
But everything is about timing.

39:05.960 --> 39:09.159
It's not too late to see it now.

39:09.159 --> 39:13.480
- Some choices could have been--
- Once I have made choices,

39:13.480 --> 39:17.260
I will not change my mind.

39:20.840 --> 39:22.719
The third chapter of this new book records

39:22.719 --> 39:26.559
that after the completion of water projects
in the seven prefectures,

39:26.559 --> 39:28.739
grain production increased by 30 percent.

39:29.639 --> 39:31.139
Have you read it?

39:33.280 --> 39:35.780
I just wonder if that 30 percent of grain

39:36.559 --> 39:41.519
is enough to feed those laborers
who dug the canals and built the dikes.

39:41.519 --> 39:44.780
Beneath prosperity, there are always shadows.

39:46.679 --> 39:50.179
In recent years,
the country has been peaceful and prosperous.

39:52.800 --> 39:55.119
Peaceful and prosperous?

39:55.119 --> 39:59.280
But blood and tears are erased from the book.

39:59.280 --> 40:03.980
The peace on paper is built
on countless corpses.

40:08.000 --> 40:10.000
I am in the Ning Empire.

40:10.000 --> 40:11.679
As a citizen,

40:11.679 --> 40:13.719
I watch the country grow increasingly strong

40:13.719 --> 40:15.239
and prosperous.

40:15.239 --> 40:17.000
As a subject,

40:17.000 --> 40:18.760
I witness how hard His Majesty works

40:18.760 --> 40:20.920
to make people live and work in peace.

40:20.920 --> 40:23.239
The true peace we seek will come

40:23.239 --> 40:25.119
in the not-too-distant future.

40:25.119 --> 40:27.380
But what about those
who cannot wait until then?

40:40.039 --> 40:41.600
I believe

40:42.308 --> 40:44.719
the sky will clear up after the rain.

40:44.719 --> 40:49.000
The Rain Bell,
in essence, creates an illusion.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.800
If you look at it for a while,

40:50.800 --> 40:53.940
you'll actually forget
that the rain has never stopped.

40:59.199 --> 41:02.900
Even the rainbow is fake.

41:42.480 --> 41:43.980
Meng.

41:49.239 --> 41:52.199
You remain calm even in big trouble.

41:52.199 --> 41:54.960
Now, you actually seem nervous.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.840
After all, she's marrying His Majesty.

41:56.840 --> 41:59.380
If she says she's not nervous,
I won't believe it.

42:01.459 --> 42:05.079
Come on. Tonight, let's get drunk.

42:05.079 --> 42:06.579
Cheers.

42:19.920 --> 42:21.699
- Cheers.
- Alright.
